{"name":"Wishard","hex":"#53786a","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Sidney & Lois Eskenazi Hospital","blocks":[{"text":"The Sidney & Lois Eskenazi Hospital is a public hospital located in Indianapolis, Indiana, United States. The hospital is the flagship medical center for Eskenazi Health, founded in 1859 as Indiana's oldest public healthcare system. The hospital is operated by Health and Hospital Corporation of Marion County. The current hospital opened December 7, 2013, less than 1,300 feet (400 m) to the west of the original campus, replacing Wishard Memorial Hospital."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Sidney_%26_Lois_Eskenazi_Hospital_Indianapolis_July_2022.jpg/330px-Sidney_%26_Lois_Eskenazi_Hospital_Indianapolis_July_2022.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sidney_%26_Lois_Eskenazi_Hospital"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Wishard_Hospital_infant_operating_room%2C_c._1916.jpg/500px-Wishard_Hospital_infant_operating_room%2C_c._1916.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Wishard_Hospital_infant_operating_room%2C_c._1916.jpg/1280px-Wishard_Hospital_infant_operating_room%2C_c._1916.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/71/Wishard_Hospital_infant_operating_room%2C_c._1916.jpg/500px-Wishard_Hospital_infant_operating_room%2C_c._1916.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An infant operating table in Wishard Hospital, c. 1916","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWishard_Hospital_infant_operating_room%2C_c._1916.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/T.C._Steele%27s_%22The_Four_Seasons%22_at_Eskenazi_